LanguageData.SC_LetterTextAlive:
Collapsing rock has buried the following under the rubble:

{0}

Those still alive are pinned and bleeding. Mine out the collapsed rocks to reach them before it's too late. Make sure the roof around the dig is supported, or it may come down again.

LanguageData.SC_LetterTextDead:
Collapsing rock has buried the following under the rubble:

{0}

Mine out the collapsed rocks to recover the bodies.

LanguageData.SC_AlertDesc:
These are trapped alive under collapsed rocks:

{0}

They are pinned and can't move. Their wounds bleed more slowly under the weight of the rubble, but they will die if left there. Mine out the collapsed rocks to free them.
